# RAG Learning Journey

A hands-on journey to learn and build Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems using Python and LangChain.

## Goal

Build a strong understanding of RAG from the fundamentals to production-ready systems through daily experimentation and projects.

## Topics

- Document Loaders
- Document Processing
- Text Splitting
- Chunking Strategies
- Embeddings
- Vector Databases
- Similarity Search
- Retrievers
- Prompt Engineering
- LangChain
- LCEL
- RAG Pipelines
- Reranking
- Hybrid Search
- Query Transformation
- RAG Evaluation
- Production RAG

